<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Educación Financiera - EBC Ultra</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
   
    <style>
        :root {
            --ebc-blue: #002855;
            --ebc-gold: #EAA015;
            --bg-dark: #070b14;
            --text-light: #e2e8f0;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --success: #10b981;
            --danger: #ef4444;
            --glass-bg: rgba(20, 30, 50, 0.4);
            --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            --glow-gold: rgba(234, 160, 21, 0.4);
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Poppins', system-ui, sans-serif;
            margin: 0; padding: 0;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 15% 10%, #002855 0%, var(--bg-dark) 50%, #03060a 100%);
            color: var(--text-light);
            overflow-x: hidden;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .glass-card {
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        .pantalla { display: none; }
        .pantalla.activa-flex { display: flex; animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease; }
        .pantalla.activa-block { display: block; animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease; }
        @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }

        /* --- AUTH --- */
        #login-screen, #register-screen, #recovery-screen {
            flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 100vh; position: relative;
        }

        .decor-circle { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(80px); z-index: -1; }
        .circle-1 { width: 300px; height: 300px; background: var(--ebc-gold); top: 10%; left: 20%; opacity: 0.2; }
        .circle-2 { width: 400px; height: 400px; background: #00ffc6; bottom: 10%; right: 10%; opacity: 0.1; }

        .auth-box { width: 360px; padding: 40px; text-align: center; }
        .logo-container { margin-bottom: 25px; animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite; }
        .logo-container svg { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(234, 160, 21, 0.4)); }
        .logo-text { color: white; font-size: 24px; margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px; }

        @keyframes float { 0% { transform: translateY(0px); } 50% { transform: translateY(-10px); } 100% { transform: translateY(0px); } }

        .auth-box h2 { color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 25px; font-weight: 400; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
       
        .auth-box input {
            width: 100%; padding: 14px; margin: 10px 0;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 8px; color: white; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            transition: all 0.3s; box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .auth-box input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--ebc-gold); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--glow-gold); }
       
        .password-container { position: relative; width: 100%; }
        .toggle-password {
            position: absolute; right: 15px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);
            cursor: pointer; color: var(--text-muted); user-select: none; font-size: 18px; transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .toggle-password:hover { transform: translateY(-50%) scale(1.1); }

        button { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; }
        .btn-primary {
            width: 100%; padding: 14px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--ebc-gold), #d18d0f);
            color: #000; border: none; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 800; font-size: 16px;
            margin-top: 20px; transition: 0.3s; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px var(--glow-gold);
        }
        .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 8px 25px var(--glow-gold); }
       
        .auth-link { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); }
        .auth-link a { color: var(--ebc-gold); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.2s;}
        .auth-link a:hover { text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--glow-gold); }
        .error-msg, .success-msg { font-size: 13px; display: none; margin-top: -5px; font-weight: 600; }
        .error-msg { color: var(--danger); }
        .success-msg { color: var(--success); }

        /* --- NAVBAR --- */
        header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 15px 40px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
        .header-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; }
        .menu-btn { font-size: 24px; cursor: pointer; background: none; border: none; color: white; transition: 0.3s; }
        .menu-btn:hover { color: var(--ebc-gold); transform: scale(1.1); }
       
        .header-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
        .header-logo svg { max-width: 30px; }
        .header-logo span { color: white; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px; }

        .user-info { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); }
        .profile-pic { width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--ebc-gold), #f39c12); color: #000; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--glow-gold); }
        .logout-btn { background: none; border: none; color: var(--danger); cursor: pointer; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 5px; font-weight: 600; transition: 0.2s;}
        .logout-btn:hover { color: #ff6b6b; text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.5);}

        .ticker-wrap { width: 100%; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border); height: 46px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }

        /* --- LAYOUT & SIDEBAR --- */
        .layout { display: flex; min-height: calc(100vh - 120px); }
       
        #sidebar { width: 260px; min-width: 260px; border-right: 1px solid var(--glass-border); padding: 25px 20px; transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.8, 0.25, 1); margin-left: -300px; opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; z-index: 50; }
        #sidebar.abierto { margin-left: 0; opacity: 1; visibility: visible; }

        .sidebar-info { margin-bottom: 25px; padding-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border); }
        .sidebar-info strong { font-size: 18px; color: white; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
        .sidebar-section-title { font-size: 11px; color: var(--ebc-gold); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 800; }
        #sidebar a { display: block; color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 15px; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.3s; margin-bottom: 5px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;}
        #sidebar a:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: white; transform: translateX(5px); border-left: 3px solid var(--ebc-gold); }

        /* --- CONTENIDO --- */
        .content { flex-grow: 1; padding: 30px 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; transition: 0.4s; }
       
        .top-widgets { display: flex; width: 100%; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: stretch; }
       
        .live-market-widget { flex: 1; min-width: 300px; padding: 25px; border-top: 4px solid var(--ebc-gold); }
        .market-title { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;}
        .market-data { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 15px; }
        .market-item { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4); padding: 15px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); transition: 0.3s; }
        .market-item:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: var(--ebc-gold); box-shadow: 0 5px 15px var(--glow-gold); }
        .market-item p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); }
        .market-item span { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: white; display: block; margin-top: 5px;}

        .news-widget { flex: 1; min-width: 300px; padding: 15px; border-top: 4px solid var(--ebc-gold); display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 250px; }
        .news-title { font-size: 16px; color: white; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 15px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; }
        .badge-live { font-size: 10px; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 6px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 800; background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2); color: var(--success); border: 1px solid var(--success);}
        .news-container { flex-grow: 1; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; position: relative; }

        .modules-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; width: 100%; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .module-card { padding: 30px 20px; text-align: center; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.4s; animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease backwards; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
        .module-card:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.1s; } .module-card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
        .module-card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.3s; } .module-card:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }

        @keyframes fadeInUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }

        .module-card:hover { transform: translateY(-10px); border-color: var(--ebc-gold); box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); background: rgba(20, 30, 50, 0.7); }
        .icon-wrapper { width: 60px; height: 60px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); transition: 0.3s;}
        .module-card:hover .icon-wrapper { background: var(--glow-gold); border-color: var(--ebc-gold); transform: scale(1.1); }
        .module-card div:last-child { font-weight: 600; color: white; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;}

        .dynamic-list { width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease backwards; animation-delay: 0.5s; }
        .dynamic-item { padding: 25px; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.3s; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-left: 4px solid transparent;}
        .dynamic-item:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-left-color: var(--ebc-gold); transform: scale(1.01); }
        .dynamic-content h4 { margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: var(--ebc-gold); font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;}
        .dynamic-content p { margin: 0; color: var(--text-light); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; }
        .dynamic-arrow { color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 300; font-size: 24px; transition: 0.3s;}
        .dynamic-item:hover .dynamic-arrow { color: var(--ebc-gold); transform: translateX(5px); }

        /* --- MODALES --- */
        .modal-overlay { display: none; position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; background-color: rgba(0, 5, 15, 0.8); z-index: 1000; justify-content: center; align-items: center; backdrop-filter: blur(8px); }
        .modal-content { background: #111827; border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); padding: 40px; border-radius: 20px; width: 90%; max-width: 550px; max-height: 85vh; overflow-y: auto; position: relative; animation: modalPop 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275); box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); border-top: 4px solid var(--ebc-gold); color: white;}
        @keyframes modalPop { from { transform: scale(0.8); opacity: 0; } to { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; } }

        .close-btn { position: absolute; top: 20px; right: 25px; font-size: 30px; cursor: pointer; color: var(--text-muted); transition: 0.2s; line-height: 1;}
        .close-btn:hover { color: var(--danger); transform: rotate(90deg); }
        .modal-content h2 { color: white; margin-top: 0; font-size: 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border); padding-bottom: 15px; font-weight: 600;}
       
        .input-group { margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: left; }
        .input-group label { display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;}
        .input-interactivo { width: 100%; padding: 14px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); border-radius: 8px; font-size: 16px; color: white; box-sizing: border-box; transition: 0.3s; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;}
        .input-interactivo:focus { border-color: var(--ebc-gold); outline: none; box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--glow-gold); }
       
        .resultado-box { margin-top: 25px; padding: 20px; background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1); border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2); display: none; }
        .resultado-box.activo { display: block; animation: fadeInUp 0.4s ease; }
       
        .step-box { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-left: 3px solid var(--ebc-gold); }
        .step-box h3 { margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: white; font-size: 16px;}
        .step-box ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6;}
        .step-box li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .step-box li b { color: white; }
       
        .btn-mitad { width: 48%; }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--bg-dark); }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border-radius: 10px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: var(--ebc-gold); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="decor-circle circle-1"></div>
    <div class="decor-circle circle-2"></div>

    <div id="login-screen" class="pantalla activa-flex">
        <div class="auth-box glass-card">
            <div class="logo-container">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="max-width: 80px;">
                    <path d="M50 10L10 40H90L50 10Z" fill="#EAA015"/>
                    <rect x="20" y="45" width="10" height="40" fill="#EAA015"/>
                    <rect x="45" y="45" width="10" height="40" fill="#EAA015"/>
                    <rect x="70" y="45" width="10" height="40" fill="#EAA015"/>
                    <path d="M10 90H90V95H10V90Z" fill="#EAA015"/>
                </svg>
                <h1 class="logo-text">EBC <span style="color: var(--ebc-gold);">ULTRA</span></h1>
            </div>
            <h2>Acceso al Portal Financiero</h2>
            <form id="formulario-login">
                <input type="email" id="login-email" placeholder="Correo electrónico" required>
                <div class="password-container">
                    <input type="password" id="login-password" placeholder="Contraseña" required>
                    <span class="toggle-password" onclick="toggleVisibilidad('login-password', this)">👁️</span>
                </div>
                <div id="login-error" class="error-msg">Credenciales incorrectas.</div>
                <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Ingresar al Sistema</button>
            </form>
            <div class="auth-link">
                <a onclick="cambiarPantalla('recovery-screen')">¿Olvidaste tu contraseña?</a><br><br>
                <span style="color:#666;">¿Eres nuevo?</span> <a onclick="cambiarPantalla('register-screen')">Crea tu cuenta Ultra</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="register-screen" class="pantalla">
        <div class="auth-box glass-card">
            <h1 class="logo-text" style="font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 20px;">EBC <span style="color: var(--ebc-gold);">ULTRA</span></h1>
            <h2>Registro de Nueva Cuenta</h2>
            <form id="formulario-registro">
                <input type="text" id="reg-nombre" placeholder="Nombre(s)" required>
                <input type="text" id="reg-apellido" placeholder="Apellidos" required>
                <input type="email" id="reg-email" placeholder="Correo electrónico" required>
                <div class="password-container">
                    <input type="password" id="reg-password" placeholder="Contraseña segura" required>
                    <span class="toggle-password" onclick="toggleVisibilidad('reg-password', this)">👁️</span>
                </div>
                <div id="reg-error" class="error-msg">Este correo ya está registrado.</div>
                <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Crear Cuenta</button>
            </form>
            <div class="auth-link">¿Ya tienes cuenta? <a onclick="cambiarPantalla('login-screen')">Inicia sesión</a></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="recovery-screen" class="pantalla">
        <div class="auth-box glass-card">
            <h2>Recuperar Acceso</h2>
            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #999; margin-bottom: 20px;">Ingresa tu correo registrado y crea una nueva contraseña.</p>
            <form id="formulario-recuperacion">
                <input type="email" id="rec-email" placeholder="Correo electrónico" required>
                <input type="password" id="rec-new-password" placeholder="Nueva contraseña" required>
                <div id="rec-error" class="error-msg">Cuenta no encontrada.</div>
                <div id="rec-success" class="success-msg">¡Actualizada con éxito!</div>
                <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Restablecer</button>
            </form>
            <div class="auth-link"><a onclick="cambiarPantalla('login-screen')">← Volver al login</a></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="main-screen" class="pantalla">
        <header class="glass-card" style="border-radius: 0; box-shadow: none;">
            <div class="header-left">
                <button class="menu-btn" onclick="toggleMenu()">☰</button>
                <div class="header-logo">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M50 10L10 40H90L50 10Z" fill="#EAA015"/><rect x="20" y="45" width="10" height="40" fill="#EAA015"/><rect x="45" y="45" width="10" height="40" fill="#EAA015"/><rect x="70" y="45" width="10" height="40" fill="#EAA015"/><path d="M10 90H90V95H10V90Z" fill="#EAA015"/>
                    </svg>
                    <span>EBC ULTRA</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="user-info">
                <div class="profile-pic" id="avatar-inicial">👤</div>
                <span id="display-date" style="margin-top: 5px;">Fecha</span>
                <button class="logout-btn" onclick="confirmarCerrarSesion()">Cerrar sesión</button>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="ticker-wrap">
            <div class="tradingview-widget-container">
                <div class="tradingview-widget-container__widget"></div>
